{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的音乐感受描写明显不如X细腻具体，尤其缺少声部、节奏、音型变化的细节，以及跟随音乐小节出现的提示。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"作为普通观众，Y的左右分工比较清楚：左边用完整的话交代人物经历和心理转折，右边用少量短词补充感受，比较容易边听边抓住主线，也更容易明白他为什么矛盾、为什么逐渐改变。X的优势是音乐细节丰富，情绪层次和具体声音变化更鲜明，而且定时出现的提示能贴合音乐进程；但信息持续增多，容易让人忙于接收提示而顾不上人物故事。整体我更愿意看Y，但希望保留X那种细致而准确的音乐描写。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c1b72b5e-452d-4acf-9ee0-6f3716224aca", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T182056605456Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.203, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T18:22:15.811134+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "940bc9d40701e29630ac1e10e94276d055ccb4c0f63791635e47f658cc5a595c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt